WEBVTT

00:32:57.890 --> 00:33:01.379
Lizet Ocampo: So we turn our cameras on
and there I am as something else.

00:33:01.403 --> 00:33:03.491
At first, we didn't realize
it was a potato.

00:33:03.515 --> 00:33:04.993
We're like, "What is going on?"

00:33:05.017 --> 00:33:07.286
I just essentially
was a potato for the meeting.

00:33:07.310 --> 00:33:10.251
AG: But some of the solutions
might be easier than you think.

00:33:10.275 --> 00:33:12.374
(Music)

00:33:12.398 --> 00:33:14.472
"WorkLife" is hosted by me, Adam Grant.

00:33:14.496 --> 00:33:16.917
The show is produced by TED
with Transmitter Media.

00:33:16.941 --> 00:33:19.863
Our team includes Colin Helms,
Gretta Cohn, Dan O'Donnell,

00:33:19.887 --> 00:33:21.784
Constanza Gallardo, Grace Rubenstein,

00:33:21.808 --> 00:33:24.597
Michelle Quint, Angela Cheng
and Anna Phelin.

00:33:24.621 --> 00:33:26.996
This episode was produced
by Jessica Glazer.

00:33:27.020 --> 00:33:28.538
Our show is mixed by Rick Kwan.

00:33:28.562 --> 00:33:31.770
Original music by Hahnsdale Hsu
and Allison Layton-Brown.